setup_ipd_range = The PICO 4 takes 58 to 72 mm.
lens_close_warning = Closer than 62 mm, the lenses can press on your nose. Tick here to accept that, then move them closer with care.
setup_ready_title = Ready for Steam
setup_ready_text = Steam starts when you choose %s. Sign in there.
